– by TLS is you do a challenge response.

246
00:10:22,079 --> 00:10:25,839
It's you […] with three messages. You send

247
00:10:25,839 --> 00:10:30,399
a request, the host sends you back a

248
00:10:30,399 --> 00:10:33,600
nonce, you sign the nonce or encrypt the

249
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:35,839
nonce, send it back and then they decrypt

250
00:10:35,839 --> 00:10:38,800
